    "text": "By Marissa Brunkhorst ,\n1 days ago\nSIOUX FALLS, S.D. (KELO) — Here’s a look at this morning’s top stories.\nA Sioux Falls jury says 40-year-old Edward Brinkley is not guilty of both second-degree murder and first-degree manslaughter, according to a press email from a court administrator.\nUPDATE: Brinkley found not guilty of murder Operation Prairie Thunder is expected to arrive in the Brookings area this week. The news worries some residents.\nBrookings residents react to Operation: Prairie Thunder",
